  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAPACITY IOM Nigeria: Immigration and Borders (IB) 2024-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under the auspices of the IOM &#x2013; Denmark Migration Management Programme, the expected intervention in Nigeria focuses on supporting the Federal Government in improving migration management and governance through technical assessment, capacity development, infrastructure improvements and policy development. This multi-level and coordinated approach aims at tackling migration management challenges in a comprehensive and whole-of-government manner, in pursuit of the promotion of economic development and welfare of Nigeria.</narrative>
  </description>
